  "contentHtml": "<DIV>\r\n<DIV class=txc-textbox style=\"BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199)\">\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><B><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</SPAN></SPAN></B></P></DIV>\r\n<P><BR>여러 가지 힘을 배우고 나서</P>\r\n<P>각 힘의 개념, 방향, 크기, 실생활 관련된 것들을 타이포 그래피나 만화로 표현해보는 활동을 해보았습니다.</P>\r\n<P>여학생들이라 그런지 재미있게, 열심히 하더라구요.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2560B43C5567FFAB01\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150526_101356.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2560B43C5567FFAB01BA2A\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2546073C5567FFAD12\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150526_101413.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2546073C5567FFAD12DE58\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/234ED13C5567FFAE0D\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150529_143854.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"576\"  id=\"A_234ED13C5567FFAE0D06A6\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2747353C5567FFAF0F\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150529_143902.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"596\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"596\"  id=\"A_2747353C5567FFAF0F145D\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21517A3C5567FFB10B\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150529_143910.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"695\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"695\"  id=\"A_21517A3C5567FFB10B5AE6\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25359A3C5567FFB318\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150529_143917.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"701\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"701\"  id=\"A_25359A3C5567FFB3188FF7\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2752D73C5567FFB40A\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150529_143937.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"576\"  id=\"A_2752D73C5567FFB40AF50F\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/266A05345567FFBB27\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20150529_143945.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"562\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"562\"  id=\"A_266A05345567FFBB27E15A\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/251455345567FFBC0D\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filen